sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CAM as Camera RTSP Source
    participant VPN as vpn_cloud tunnel
    participant RTSP as rtsp_cloud
    participant BR as RtspBridge GStreamer
    participant MON as odc-rtsp-monitor

    Note over CAM,MON: Binding sets input_uri = rtsp://tunnel_ip:8554/stream

    CAM->>VPN: RTSP H.264 on tunnel subnet
    RTSP->>BR: start with TransportBinding
    BR->>VPN: rtspsrc ingest from tunnel IP
    BR->>BR: decode → x265enc → rtph265pay
    BR->>RTSP: GstRTSPServer output port 8555
    MON->>RTSP: connect rtsp://0.0.0.0:8555/stream
    RTSP->>EB: RtspCompressorStatusEvent running
    RTSP->>EB: metrics bandwidth fps
